## 17. Incident Reporting

### 17.1 Reportable Events

The following LOTO-related events must be reported immediately:
- Any injury related to unexpected energization
- Any near-miss involving energy release
- Any unauthorized removal of lock or tag
- Any attempt to operate locked out equipment
- Any discovery of inadequate lockout during work
- Any failure of lockout device

### 17.2 Reporting Procedure

| Step | Action | Responsibility |
|------|--------|----------------|
| 1 | Stop work immediately | Discoverer |
| 2 | Secure the area | Supervisor |
| 3 | Notify Supervisor and EHS Manager | Discoverer |
| 4 | Do not disturb evidence | All personnel |
| 5 | Complete incident report | Supervisor + EHS |
| 6 | Conduct investigation | EHS Manager |
| 7 | Implement corrective actions | Maintenance Supervisor + EHS |
| 8 | Communicate lessons learned | EHS Manager |

