│   1. Primary Employee isolates equipment                 │
│   2. Primary Employee places keys in lockbox             │
│   3. Primary Employee locks box FIRST                    │
│   4. Each additional employee locks box                  │
│                                                          │
│   ┌─────────────┐                                        │
│   │  LOCKBOX    │ ← Keys to isolation points inside     │
│   │ ┌─┐┌─┐┌─┐┌─┐│ ← Multiple locks on hasp              │
│   │ └─┘└─┘└─┘└─┘│                                        │
│   └─────────────┘                                        │
│                                                          │
│   Removal (reverse order):                               │
│   • Each employee removes their lock                     │
│   • Primary Employee removes lock LAST                   │
│   • Primary Employee removes isolation locks             │
│                                                          │
│   NEVER leave box unlocked during active lockout!        │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
